Subject: [PATCH] Carpet owned plant growth and bonemeal

From Lophine 7a51f49a, Minecraft 0131, 0132. See META-INF/licenses/carpet-26.3.txt.
Reuse native random ticks and their Paper events in owned, loaded footprints. Use the existing bonemeal and item spawn paths.

Additional source:
From: Bacteriawa <A3167717663@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Mar 2026 01:39:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Carpet AMS features

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/block/BambooStalkBlock.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/block/BambooStalkBlock.java
--- a/net/minecraft/world/level/block/BambooStalkBlock.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/level/block/BambooStalkBlock.java
@@ -101,6 +101,11 @@
     protected void tick(final BlockState state, final ServerLevel level, final BlockPos pos, final RandomSource random) {
         if (!state.canSurvive(level, pos)) {
             level.destroyBlock(pos, true);
+            return;
+        }
+        if ((fun.bm.mili.carpet.config.modules.WorldGameplayConfig.scheduledRandomTickAllPlants || fun.bm.mili.carpet.config.modules.WorldGameplayConfig.scheduledRandomTickBamboo)
+            && fun.bm.mili.carpet.WorldGameplayRules.ownsLoadedBox(level, pos.getX() - 1, pos.getZ() - 1, pos.getX() + 1, pos.getZ() + 1)) {
+            state.randomTick(level, pos, random);
         }
     }
 
